From saroj at vt.edu  Tue Jun  2 18:48:13 2009
From: saroj at vt.edu (Saroj K Mohapatra)
Date: Tue, 02 Jun 2009 12:48:13 -0400
Subject: [BioC] variable as argument to makeContrasts (limma)
