Subject: [BioC]  Change M-value calculation from red/green to green/red
In-Reply-To: <mailman.15.1244714403.24001.bioconductor@stat.math.ethz.ch>
References: <mailman.15.1244714403.24001.bioconductor@stat.math.ethz.ch>
