Dear Torsten,

There is no need to fool the software as to the real nature of your data. 
Please do not do this.

Simply use

   modelMatrix(targets, ref="Ref")

where "Ref" is the name of your reference sample.  Then limma will compute 
all quantities correctly relative to the reference regardless of what dye 
was used.

Best wishes
Gordon


