Hi Guido --

to get the appropriate map

  library(annotate)
  map = getAnnMap("SYMBOL", annotation(eset))

to select just the relevant probes

  map[probeids]

toTable(map[probeids]) or as.list(map[probeids]) might be the next step
in the work flow.

Martin

